# Exclusion list for Ray's working_dir packaging.
#
# When this file exists Ray reads **only** it (not .gitignore), so it must be complete.
# Rationale: third_party/ holds vendored upstream repos (vipe / fast-foundationstereo /
# hamer, ~271 MB total). If they get packed into runtime_env, every ray.init has to
# compress and upload them, which slows tests down and can overwhelm the local Ray
# node (actors fail with "Owner's node has crashed").
third_party/
deploy/assets/
assets/
.superpowers/
run/
output/
data/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
.venv/
.git/
